Notebook[{
Cell["Talk Topic Summaries (review draft, all 17 topics)", "Title",
 CellID->874461601,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each topic gets a summary of what should catch a physicist's attention, \
then one or two showcase examples. Every example below is a condensed, \
self-contained version of cells in the source essay and was run in a fresh \
kernel with ",
 Cell[BoxData["wolframscript"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],
 " before being written here. The examples use plain matrices only; neither \
essay calls QuantumFramework."
}], "Text",
 CellID->36768919,ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],

Cell["\<\
1. Continuous Quantum Error Correction: Syndrome Estimation and Feedback\
\>", "Section",
 CellID->1699946459,ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Source: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"/", "Users"}], "/", "mohammadb"}], "/", "Documents"}], "/", 
      "GitHub"}], "/", "mbahram"}], "/", "open"}], "-", "quantum", "-", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"systems", "/", "Examples"}], " ", "on", " ", "Open", " ", 
    "Quantum", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Systems", "/", "three"}]}], "-", "qubit", "-", "bitflip", "-", 
   "continuous", "-", 
   RowBox[{"qec", ".", "md"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"]
}], "Text",
 CellID->1535504786,ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],

Cell["Summary", "Subsection",
 CellID->1208482393,ExpressionUUID->"2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The three-qubit bit-flip code is protected in continuous time: the two \
stabilizers ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "1"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "2"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "3"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],
 " are measured weakly and continuously, a classical controller turns the two \
noisy records into an estimate, and the estimate drives corrective ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],
 " pulses. The essay simulates the physical qubits and the controller's \
belief as two separate density matrices fed by the same record, which is what \
an experiment such as Livingston et al. (2022) actually runs."
}], "Text",
 CellID->28909615,ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

Cell["What should catch a physicist's attention:", "Text",
 CellID->193832008,ExpressionUUID->"166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The syndrome is readable even though each sample is useless.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " In one time step the stabilizer signal sits about eight times below the \
shot noise, yet the four syndrome probabilities track every bit flip. With \
feedback off they obey a closed, four-number stochastic equation (a Wonham \
filter), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "=", 
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"1", "-", "4", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "2", 
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[Kappa]"}], "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"],
    LimitsPositioning->False], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"j", "k"}], "TI"]], "-", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["s", "TI"], "_"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],
 ", implemented as an exact Bayes update in three lines and checked against \
the full eight-dimensional stochastic master equation."
}], "Item",
 CellID->684317082,ExpressionUUID->"6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Feedback breaks the four-number description.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Once the drive ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"f", "b"}], "TI"]], "=", 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"],
    LimitsPositioning->False], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],
 " is on, the sector populations couple to coherences between sectors, so the \
controller must carry the full ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"8", "\[Times]", "8"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],
 " estimate, not four probabilities."
}], "Item",
 CellID->528485616,ExpressionUUID->"23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The controller does not need to know the logical state.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Starting the estimate at the maximally mixed code state while the qubits \
hold ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    SubscriptBox["0", 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],
 ", the physical fidelity stays high even though the estimate gives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    SubscriptBox["0", 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    SubscriptBox["1", 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],
 " equal weight: correction acts on syndromes, not on the logical \
amplitudes."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1392207227,ExpressionUUID->"779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A wrong detector-efficiency model costs protection, and the essay \
separates two effects.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " It measures the gap between estimated and true fidelity, and separately \
the loss of physical fidelity caused by the wrong model, by pairing runs on \
identical noise."
}], "Item",
 CellID->705466992,ExpressionUUID->"2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Staying in the code space is not keeping the qubit.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The residual fidelity loss splits exactly into leakage out of the code \
space plus population in the orthogonal logical state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    SubscriptBox["1", 
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"],
 ", which no stabilizer can see."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1350516518,ExpressionUUID->"0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A feedback that protects the code space exactly.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Monitoring the error channels themselves and feeding back ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SqrtBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],
 " makes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPi]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"c", "o", "d", "e"}], "TI"]], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],
 ", so at unit efficiency every encoded state is a fixed point of the \
averaged dynamics (Wiseman-Mancini-Wang feedback master equation). Below unit \
efficiency an extra ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"],
 " term appears, and at very poor efficiency this scheme does worse than no \
feedback at all."
}], "Item",
 CellID->907546795,ExpressionUUID->"07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"],

Cell["Example 1.1: tracking bit flips from two noisy records", "Subsection",
 CellID->814772321,ExpressionUUID->"3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],

Cell["\<\
The toolkit: Pauli matrices, the stabilizers, the four sector projectors, and \
the positivity-preserving measurement step of Rouchon and Ralph (2015), which \
conditions the state on a record increment without ever leaving the set of \
valid states.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1054628905,ExpressionUUID->"1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"id2", ",", " ", "X", ",", " ", "Y", ",", " ", "Z"}], "}"}], " ", 
   "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "j", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"op3", "[", 
    RowBox[{"o_", ",", " ", "i_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", " ", "@@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"ReplacePart", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"id2", ",", " ", "id2", ",", " ", "id2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"i", " ", "->", " ", "o"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ket", "[", "bits_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
    RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"FromDigits", "[", 
         RowBox[{"bits", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", "1"}], " ", "->",
        " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "8"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"S1", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"op3", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Z", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
    RowBox[{"op3", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Z", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"S2", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"op3", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Z", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
    RowBox[{"op3", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Z", ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"signs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"proj", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "8", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"#", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "S1"}]}], ")"}], " ", ".", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "8", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"#", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "S2"}]}], ")"}]}], "/", "4"}],
      " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "signs"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",
 CellID->2043779557,ExpressionUUID->"77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"measurementStep", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "H_", ",", " ", "watched_", ",", " ", "effs_", ",", " ", "unwatched_", ",",
      " ", "dt_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"id", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "H", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"drift", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"I", " ", "H"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "#", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
              "#"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
             RowBox[{"watched", ",", " ", "unwatched"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
          "2"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"corr", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
          RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"#1", " ", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"#2", " ", ".", " ", "#2"}], ")"}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"effs", ",", " ", "watched"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "/",
          "2"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"rho", ",", " ", "dJ"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"With", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"sig", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
            RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "#2", "]"}], " ", "#1", " ", "#3"}], " ",
                "&"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"dJ", ",", " ", "effs", ",", " ", "watched"}], "}"}]}],
              "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"With", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"M", " ", "=", " ", 
             RowBox[{"id", " ", "-", " ", 
              RowBox[{"drift", " ", "dt"}], " ", "+", " ", "sig", " ", "+", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"sig", " ", ".", " ", "sig"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "-", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{"corr", " ", "dt"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"With", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"top", " ", "=", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"M", " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "M", "]"}]}], " ", "+", 
                "\n", "          ", 
                RowBox[{"dt", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"#", " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "#", "]"}]}], " ", 
                    "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "unwatched"}], "]"}]}], " ", "+", 
                "\n", "          ", 
                RowBox[{"dt", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], ")"}], " ", 
                    RowBox[{"#1", " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "#1", "]"}]}]}], " ", 
                    "&"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"watched", ",", " ", "effs"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
                  "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
             RowBox[{"top", "/", 
              RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
               RowBox[{"Tr", "[", "top", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"measurementRecord", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "rho_", ",", " ", "watched_", ",", " ", "effs_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", 
     " ", "kick_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "#3", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
         RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"#1", " ", "+", " ", 
             RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "#1", "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", ".",
            " ", "rho"}], "]"}]}], " ", "dt"}], " ", "+", " ", "#2"}], " ", 
      "&"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"watched", ",", " ", "kick", ",", " ", "effs"}], "}"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"trajectory", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "rho0_", ",", " ", "H_", ",", " ", "watched_", ",", " ", "effs_", ",", 
     " ", "unwatched_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "seed_"}],
     "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "seed", "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"step", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"measurementStep", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "H", ",", " ", "watched", ",", " ", "effs", ",", " ", "unwatched", 
            ",", " ", "dt"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"kicks", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"RandomVariate", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "dt", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
               RowBox[{"tf", "/", "dt"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Length", "[", "watched", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"With", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"states", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"FoldList", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"step", "[", 
               RowBox[{"#1", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"measurementRecord", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "#1", ",", " ", "watched", ",", " ", "effs", ",", " ", "dt", 
                  ",", " ", "#2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
             "rho0", ",", " ", "kicks"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         
         RowBox[{"<|", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\"\<states\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "states"}], ",", "\n", 
           "      ", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<record\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"measurementRecord", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                "#1", ",", " ", "watched", ",", " ", "effs", ",", " ", "dt", ",",
                  " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Most", "[", "states", "]"}], ",", " ", "kicks"}], 
               "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",
