2. A Computational Guide to Open Quantum Systems: Lindblad Dynamics, Quantum \
Trajectories, and Feedback Control\
\>", "Section",
 CellID->108435171,ExpressionUUID->"2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],

