Cell["Summary", "Subsection",
 CellID->203008389,ExpressionUUID->"7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"],

Cell["\<\
Twenty open-system problems, each built from about ten shared functions on \
plain matrices: the Lindbladian solved two independent ways (Liouvillian \
exponential and ODE), a steady-state finder that handles degenerate null \
spaces, a positivity-preserving measurement step, a trajectory generator, and \
a diagnostic that splits the gap between a trajectory ensemble and the master \
equation into Monte-Carlo scatter and time-step bias. Every example states \
its equation, computes, and checks itself against a closed form or a second \
method.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1090263105,ExpressionUUID->"7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"],

Cell["What should catch a physicist's attention:", "Text",
 CellID->1560876240,ExpressionUUID->"14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Decoherence is the price of discarding the record.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Under ideal monitoring each conditioned trajectory stays pure while the \
ensemble average mixes; the essay shows this for homodyne, heterodyne and for \
a three-channel atom where only the complete record keeps the run pure."
}], "Item",
 CellID->176337227,ExpressionUUID->"5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Why the naive stochastic master equation fails.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " One large noise kick in the textbook update gives a negative eigenvalue; \
the Kraus-form step lands exactly on the boundary of state space instead."
}], "Item",
 CellID->807053435,ExpressionUUID->"3b7fe4cc-5889-7f4e-6904-fd96593c4594"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Cats.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A cavity cat's coherence dies at a rate set by the square of its \
separation (checked against the exact Kraus solution of photon loss); in the \
Haroche experiment the cat exists only once the atom is read in the right \
basis, and the two-atom correlation tracks the coherence; in dispersive \
readout the conditional cavity is a cat that turns into a mixture as the \
pointers separate, with a closed form checked against simulation."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1633675818,ExpressionUUID->"6cb5c01f-62f5-68e0-144a-da5916803aca"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Quantum Brownian motion.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The high-temperature Caldeira-Leggett equation is not of Lindblad form, so \
the essay watches the uncertainty bound directly; a warm bath kills a cat \
faster, and at fixed delay the surviving coherence peaks at a modest cat size."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1828793009,ExpressionUUID->"55f417ec-7166-d78d-038b-8eb60010bdd7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["One leak, three unravellings.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Photon counting, homodyne and heterodyne give different histories with the \
same average; the click record shows antibunching in its waiting-time \
distribution, and the homodyne section keeps a strict ledger of what is \
observed (the record) and what is inferred (state, signal, innovation)."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1232986364,ExpressionUUID->"4b6e5dad-9702-0c1f-7916-54f722b75765"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Two thresholds where one is expected.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " For a driven, watched qubit the Liouvillian eigenvalues are closed-form, \
with an exceptional point at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d359769-845f-cd94-44ca-0f332deb97fe"],
 " and a Zeno freeze rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2055bfee-d4b5-7aa2-506a-36cbdd404888"],
 ". In the charge qubit read by a quantum point contact, the spectral peaks \
merge already at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]", "/", 
   SqrtBox["2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "64c30c0d-1857-1b13-0cf0-a65799e26679"],
 ", before the eigenvalues coalesce at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46632a09-cc5f-b0ef-6e10-cc52e5eb0235"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellID->762269937,ExpressionUUID->"6ea251ed-865f-e03c-1652-48b733ebb306"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Collapse and Born's rule as a martingale.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Under pure measurement every run tends to a pole while the mean stays \
fixed, which forces ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[PlusMinus]"], "=", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"1", "\[PlusMinus]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "0"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25a0bfbe-b1d4-2428-535f-36fbc0668f72"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellID->405213039,ExpressionUUID->"04786d0e-016a-d127-2c07-8568b01ca00d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Quantum Kalman filter.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Watching position squeezes the conditional variance below the zero-point \
value, and the steady state sits exactly at the Heisenberg floor for every \
measurement strength, in closed form."
}], "Item",
 CellID->2118931930,ExpressionUUID->"2d15b43a-cd49-5244-5b2a-2e67e4fc20ae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Feedback in three guises.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Wiseman-Milburn feedback purifies a maximally mixed qubit onto a dark \
state; Jacobs rapid purification beats the unsteered measurement on the mean \
at fixed time yet loses on mean first-passage time (the Wiseman-Ralph point, \
read off distributions); feedback cooling shows watching alone heats, an \
optimal gain exists, and the conditional covariance sets a floor no gain can \
cross."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1039057480,ExpressionUUID->"2d1ff276-b82a-c3ca-5b24-f43039dc9110"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Thermalization derives the canonical ensemble.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Detailed balance between ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["T", "TI"]], "+", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14fd1512-f616-8834-3c82-8d5f83a0db1e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["T", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66c67103-72a1-9427-0efe-696d0755ff0d"],
 " forces the whole thermal distribution, not only its mean."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1411198270,ExpressionUUID->"48c794f4-84f6-2bfc-78fc-0dbe2c8379c6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Linear versus nonlinear trajectories.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The norm of the linear stochastic Schrodinger state is the likelihood \
ratio ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["P", "TI"], "/", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "58ee7ecb-1370-1005-0896-7795a605636f"],
 "; equal-weight averaging gives a bias no ensemble size removes, and the \
effective sample size decays with time."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1703453532,ExpressionUUID->"11d04a92-cbef-a8a5-47e0-63dfed9bfa8f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Mollow triplet and squeezed fluorescence.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " From one Liouvillian, by quantum regression: a single line at weak drive, \
three lines at strong drive, and a homodyne spectrum that dips below shot \
noise."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1477609488,ExpressionUUID->"7d9821c9-0e61-bc6d-2ba7-b893ab1506b7"],

Cell["\<\
Example 2.1: the quantum Zeno crossover as an exceptional point\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->1030824397,ExpressionUUID->"3181a460-bc62-f1ee-67be-3e4a3514c334"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"id2", ",", " ", "X", ",", " ", "Y", ",", " ", "Z"}], "}"}], " ", 
   "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "j", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H_", ",", " ", "leaks_List", ",", " ", "d_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"id", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "d", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
          RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "id"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
          RowBox[{"id", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "H", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+",
       "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
         RowBox[{"c", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
            RowBox[{"c", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "c", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "-", "\n", 
           "        ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}], " ", ".", " ",
                  "c"}], ",", " ", "id"}], "]"}], " ", "+", "\n", 
              "           ", 
              RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
               RowBox[{"id", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}], " ", ".", 
                  " ", "c"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], "]"}], 
        " ", "/@", " ", "leaks"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[10]:= ",
 CellID->100031176,ExpressionUUID->"3937e1d4-04c3-e55a-68cc-f89ead77cfa0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A qubit Rabi-driven at ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b45e796-37a7-eecc-197a-fed04253b416"],
 " while ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e187950-8ca2-2ab2-0638-711a25577898"],
 " is watched at strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "250a2d7c-9b81-05b0-5309-c5261e346f9a"],
 ", fully symbolic:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->144223354,ExpressionUUID->"15a9104d-5625-6af3-4356-8a1763d038d9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "@", 
  RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "X"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "k", "]"}], " ", "Z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "2"}], 
     "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
     RowBox[{"k", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[11]:= ",
 CellID->1443527617,ExpressionUUID->"58c17d8b-1b7e-6f79-08ff-74d59e0b3243"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The spectrum is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "0"}], ",", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "2"}], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]}], ",", "\[ThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      StyleBox["k", "TI"]}], "\[PlusMinus]", 
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["k", "TI"], "2"], "-", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"]}]]}]}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "43821c38-6720-b4f9-71b1-966212da1ec3"],
 ": the Rabi pair oscillates for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "<", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "341c54d9-3079-6bba-5c24-4d83410c3980"],
 ", coalesces at the exceptional point ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbf9c2b-d84a-d79b-4b44-1674d9fcbde1"],
 ", and splits into two real rates beyond it. The slow one is the Zeno freeze:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->311511756,ExpressionUUID->"0f449897-1a0e-51e7-357b-11d19fbb23cd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
  RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "k"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"k", "^", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "Infinity", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[12]:= ",
 CellID->1381425643,ExpressionUUID->"6d5a63ab-93b9-14f3-1b7a-7af5264c7ed9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"r", " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r", "^", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
    " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", "1", "}"}], ",", " ", "None"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Rabi frequency / \[CapitalOmega]\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<slowest decay rate / \[CapitalOmega]\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<k/\[CapitalOmega]\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<Liouvillian eigenvalue / \[CapitalOmega]\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[13]:= ",
 CellID->377280352,ExpressionUUID->"5077c06e-c394-b43c-000c-da4bf6261f06"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Watching harder speeds relaxation only up to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07359582-e823-44a1-2eca-0cef89d62e8b"],
 "; past it the slowest rate falls as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c239bd0-3ff5-3b18-25d0-129ab9818662"],
 " and the qubit freezes."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1717363484,ExpressionUUID->"68c76573-72ce-0c1a-18fd-7d3d077b5760"],

Cell["\<\
Example 2.2: the Mollow triplet and fluorescence squeezed below shot noise\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->1781880651,ExpressionUUID->"6184d2f2-049e-728e-17bb-cbbcad2b40d4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two-time correlations run on the same Liouvillian as the state (quantum \
regression), so a spectrum is one linear solve per frequency. At ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4fd967ef-5008-0b29-75e7-7ec961bd5673"],
 " the system is singular, and the trace condition picks the physical \
branch:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1536527082,ExpressionUUID->"19bb1c5e-57ab-6e36-4f58-9618625e351c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"lower", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"X", " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"I", " ", "Y"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"steady", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H_", ",", " ", "leaks_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"First", "@", 
          RowBox[{"NullSpace", "[", 
           RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
            RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "leaks", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"v", "/", 
      RowBox[{"Tr", "[", "v", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"resolventSpectrum", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "big_", ",", " ", "seedMat_", ",", " ", "readout_", ",", " ", "tones_"}], 
    "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "big", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"d", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "readout", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
         RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
          RowBox[{"readout", " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "w", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
                RowBox[{"10", "^", 
                 RowBox[{"-", "9"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
               RowBox[{"LeastSquares", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "big"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"1.", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "d", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
                    "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "seedMat", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"{", "0.", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
               "       ", 
               RowBox[{"LinearSolve", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"I", " ", "w", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ",
                   "big"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "seedMat", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", "d"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"w", ",", " ", "tones"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[14]:= ",
 CellID->1621535814,ExpressionUUID->"5c8dcc56-7aa9-964a-04b2-e6107f5dfc90"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The inelastic fluorescence spectrum of a resonantly driven atom (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30baa1c8-66ad-75e0-6059-389213585fca"],
 "), weak against strong drive:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1193935837,ExpressionUUID->"52535901-cb26-8b9c-0261-516aeed0d9e6"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"mollow", "[", 
    RowBox[{"om_", ",", " ", "tones_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"big", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"om", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "X"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "lower", "}"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rss", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"steady", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"om", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "X"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "lower", "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"dm", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"lower", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lower", " ", ".", " ", "rss"}], "]"}], " ", "id2"}]}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"resolventSpectrum", "[", 
        RowBox[{"big", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"dm", " ", ".", " ", "rss"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "dm", "]"}], ",", " ", "tones"}], 
        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tones", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "9"}], ",", " ", "9", ",", " ", "0.05"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"weak", ",", " ", "strong"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"mollow", "[", 
      RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "tones"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"0.6", ",", " ", "6."}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"tones", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"weak", "/", 
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", "weak", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"tones", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"strong", "/", 
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", "strong", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<\[CapitalOmega] = 0.6\[Gamma]\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<\[CapitalOmega] = 6\[Gamma]\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<frequency - drive frequency\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<inelastic spectrum (scaled to peak)\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[15]:= ",
 CellID->105329933,ExpressionUUID->"323a4b1c-b138-a791-63da-6359c0b20dfb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Strong driving dresses the atom and splits one line into three, with \
sidebands at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7421cf44-a1ac-4319-1dde-e721d0592e63"],
 ". A homodyne detector reading the in-phase quadrature sees something a \
spectrometer cannot; at zero frequency:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1234416869,ExpressionUUID->"511b3347-8d7d-ab60-0738-ab212409f64a"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"homodyneS0", "[", "om_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"big", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"om", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "X"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "lower", "}"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rss", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"steady", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"om", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "X"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "lower", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", "cth", ",", " ", 
       "mq"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"cth", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "lower"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"mq", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"cth", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "cth", "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"First", "@", 
        RowBox[{"resolventSpectrum", "[", 
         RowBox[{"big", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"cth", " ", ".", " ", "rss"}], " ", "+", " ", 
           RowBox[{"rss", " ", ".", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "cth", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
           
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
             RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
              RowBox[{"mq", " ", ".", " ", "rss"}], "]"}]}], " ", "rss"}]}], ",",
           "\n", "      ", 
          RowBox[{"mq", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
             RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
              RowBox[{"mq", " ", ".", " ", "rss"}], "]"}]}], " ", "id2"}]}], ",",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "0.", "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Max", "@", 
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"homodyneS0", "[", "om", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"8", " ", 
         RowBox[{"om", "^", "2"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"4", " ", 
             RowBox[{"om", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], "/", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
             RowBox[{"2", " ", 
              RowBox[{"om", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}], "^", "3"}]}]}]}], ")"}]}], 
     "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"om", ",", " ", "0.05", ",", " ", "1.2", ",", " ", "0.05"}], 
     "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[16]:= ",
 CellID->240380995,ExpressionUUID->"36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The numerical spectrum is the closed form ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "0", 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "1", "+", "8", 
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"4", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], "-", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", "2", 
      SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "3"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"],
 " to machine precision, so the deepest squeezing follows exactly:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1771870337,ExpressionUUID->"519775d4-d545-25f2-07ad-6c91dcf18fd8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Minimize", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"8", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "^", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"4", " ", 
           RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], 
         ")"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
           RowBox[{"2", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}], "^", 
         "3"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   "\[CapitalOmega]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[17]:= ",
 CellID->305160771,ExpressionUUID->"5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The fluorescence noise falls below the vacuum level for every drive ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "<", 
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06ecfdb3-2197-c9b0-2e93-f4fd50239b9a"],
 ", deepest at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"3", "-", 
     SqrtBox["7"]}]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12d95fcb-3316-2212-42e7-569546a37178"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "0", 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"323", "-", "56", 
    SqrtBox["7"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", "243"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "733995c2-f5bf-78ee-22c6-0caffc4a4a34"],
 ": nonclassical light from a single driven atom, visible only to \
phase-sensitive detection."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1896945989,ExpressionUUID->"4f8ab258-7e7f-0723-7589-34027b0a6a09"],

Cell["\<\
3. Wong-Zakai Regularization for Continuous Quantum Measurement with NDSolve\
\>", "Section",
 CellID->653417278,ExpressionUUID->"6b12ee74-9953-131d-1921-003e18e67e67"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Source: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"/", "Users"}], "/", "mohammadb"}], "/", "Documents"}], "/", 
      "GitHub"}], "/", "mbahram"}], "/", "continuous"}], "-", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"measurement", "/", "Discrete"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Space", "/", "NDSolve"}], " ", "vs", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Ito", "/", "Regularized"}]}], "-", "SDE", "-", "NDSolve", "-", 
   RowBox[{"Simulation", ".", "md"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65262d3c-fccc-1dc6-0cdd-c579f579672c"]
}], "Text",
 CellID->1067269536,ExpressionUUID->"5e157ee2-48da-d240-062b-77cc696ca0aa"],

Cell["Summary", "Subsection",
 CellID->49659130,ExpressionUUID->"78287f93-0f12-7c52-2828-76ddaaa746b8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A continuously monitored, driven qubit (homodyne readout of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "08285353-0e0e-39f8-3828-4b1dabb88bc2"],
 ", with relaxation, dephasing and phase backaction) is written as one \
four-component stochastic equation: three Bloch components and the detector's \
accumulated readout ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1daed7d3-93e8-7698-4b55-ce9d259d5ce2"],
 ", all kicked by the same scalar noise. ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "187adc3d-3961-76c2-4819-d667b8145c28"],
 " cannot integrate white noise, so the essay converts the It\[OHat] equation \
to its Stratonovich form, replaces the Wiener path by a continuous \
piecewise-cubic interpolant, and hands ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "641c78eb-7f03-7846-0c24-71b57ab64aac"],
 " the resulting random ODE. By the Wong-Zakai theorem this converges to the \
Stratonovich (hence the original It\[OHat]) solution as the noise grid is \
refined, which works here because the noise is scalar."
}], "Text",
 CellID->464508221,ExpressionUUID->"5bfcc75d-c21d-6fb0-0983-df06f7a8359a"],

Cell["What should catch a physicist's attention:", "Text",
 CellID->1361313038,ExpressionUUID->"112ae6ec-4b5c-6ad2-4729-ffb66ee93838"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The exact algebra is checked symbolically, with all six rates \
symbolic.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"ItoProcess", "[", 
   RowBox[{"StratonovichProcess", "[", "...", "]"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6121b9de-dddd-aca8-10de-309bd469f6f2"],
 " converts the Stratonovich field back and lands exactly on the affine \
Lindblad drift; the Lindblad generator projected on Pauli components \
reproduces the same drift."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1907680634,ExpressionUUID->"30209679-023a-ee91-61df-0823b7ccb4fb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A positivity condition derived, not assumed.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The It\[OHat] generator of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["r", "TI"], "2"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "29bc1606-c22d-409d-5f43-8863f7d812e7"],
 " on the Bloch sphere is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"1", "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "-", "2", 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "+", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bf1e1bf-5b3e-c64b-298e-f8f95ec8ac91"],
 ", so the trajectory stays a density matrix if and only if ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "2", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"],
 ", i.e. detector efficiency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "1", "+", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "/", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "62a6d1b5-4e36-fa69-125d-c8ff6bc0c8b3"],
 ". Violate it and a path leaves the ball while the equation still \
integrates; saturate it and a pure state stays exactly on the sphere along \
every single path."
}], "Item",
 CellID->483148123,ExpressionUUID->"7c41cdc9-5ab3-1ef5-247e-e4935f4664df"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The record is the noise.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Subtracting the integrated signal ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
   StyleBox["\[Integral]",
    FontSize->1.15 Inherited], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "51fce014-dca1-0630-0783-fa51d5546d1a"],
 " from one record returns the very Wiener path that kicked the state."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1195452142,ExpressionUUID->"657c1c65-980e-511d-1303-964f19bb2067"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A closed law tying state to record.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " With drive and relaxation off, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   StyleBox["tanh",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["arctanh",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "0"], "+", 
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0f15dbd5-5f35-596c-352a-d29f5ac02bb6"],
 " on every path: the monitored coordinate is the readout read through a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["tanh",
   FontSlant->"Plain"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7e9b7e66-629a-1114-26b9-7040172f607e"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1521685512,ExpressionUUID->"585a51e6-774f-2dd2-087a-48c002fa7738"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Honest numerics.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Means are checked against the closed-form Lindblad solution, spreads \
against the built-in order-3/2 ",
 Cell[BoxData["StratonovichProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d7c0b5b-c40c-ea6a-4b03-a304edbeb8b0"],
 " integrator; the essay separates the two time steps (noise grid versus \
solver step) and shows the noise grid is the one that matters, including in a \
strong-readout regime where the It\[OHat]-Stratonovich correction is large."
}], "Item",
 CellID->97201263,ExpressionUUID->"370294fd-9e49-2d35-5d31-0da71bfc741f"],

Cell["\<\
Example 3.1: the It\[OHat]-Stratonovich conversion, the Lindblad drift and \
the positivity boundary, all symbolic\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->878831761,ExpressionUUID->"2845529c-454d-b13b-587b-4bc66cf90001"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Encode the Stratonovich drift, the diffusion and the It\[OHat] (Lindblad) \
drift on a rate vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7519012f-e657-215b-2326-988893e273a1"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1048559713,ExpressionUUID->"594776df-9e75-d16a-0f7d-6f991b01a3b0"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_", ",", " ", "q_"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "gCI_", ",", " ", "gBA_", ",", " ", "gd_", ",", " ", "gphi_", ",", " ", 
       "g1_", ",", " ", "om_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"g2", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g1", "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", "gphi", " ", "+", " ", 
        "gd"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"gBA", " ", "+", " ", "gCI"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "-",
            " ", "g2", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"gCI", " ", 
            RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", "x"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"gBA", " ", "gCI"}], "]"}], " ", "y", " ", "z"}]}], ",", 
       "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"gBA", " ", "+", " ", "gCI"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "-",
            " ", "g2", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"gCI", " ", 
            RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", "y"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"gBA", " ", "gCI"}], "]"}], " ", "x", " ", "z"}], " ", "-", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"om", " ", "z"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g1", " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "z"}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"gCI", " ", "z", " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"om", " ", "y"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "gCI", "]"}], " ", "z"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_", ",", " ", "q_"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"gCI_", ",", " ", "gBA_", ",", " ", "__"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ",
    ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "gCI", "]"}]}], " ", "x", " ", "z"}], " ", "-", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "gBA", "]"}], " ", "y"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "gCI", "]"}]}], " ", "y", " ", "z"}], " ", "+", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "gBA", "]"}], " ", "x"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "gCI", "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "_", ",", " ", "_", ",", " ", "gd_", ",", " ", "gphi_", ",", " ", "g1_",
        ",", " ", "om_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"g2", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g1", "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", "gphi", " ", "+", " ", 
        "gd"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "g2"}], " ", "x"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "g2"}], " ", "y"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"om", " ", "z"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g1", " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "z"}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"om", " ", "y"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"rs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<BA\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<d\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<\[Phi]\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[18]:= ",
 CellID->300048012,ExpressionUUID->"6405505f-4b92-3bd6-0c3b-4a196e24893c"],

Cell["\<\
Convert the Stratonovich process back to It\[OHat] form and compare with the \
Lindblad drift plus the readout row:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1962937852,ExpressionUUID->"6878c7f8-419e-9db5-1807-dea27028e79f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Assuming", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ">=", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ">=", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ItoProcess", "[", 
         RowBox[{"StratonovichProcess", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
                "}"}], ",", " ", "rs"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"List", " ", "/@", " ", 
              RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
                 "}"}], ",", " ", "rs"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
              "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
              "}"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x0", ",", " ", "y0", ",", " ", "z0", ",", " ", "q0"}], 
              "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "t"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
        "[", "\"\<Drift\>\"", "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "x"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"y", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "y"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"z", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "z"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"q", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "q"}]}], "}"}]}], 
      ")"}], "\n", "   ", "==", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Append", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         "rs"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "z"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[19]:= ",
 CellID->588230824,ExpressionUUID->"48a3d607-c312-9dd3-7850-c860f6a4e739"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["True"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "539491e8-328f-8d7b-01ab-08b2473bd441"],
 ". That affine drift really is the master equation: build the Lindbladian \
with drive, relaxation and total dephasing, project on the Pauli matrices, \
subtract:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->2099309037,ExpressionUUID->"7fcf59b5-a5ca-2155-25f5-50fecc7f73bf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sx", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sy", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sz", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sm", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"rho", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"x", " ", "sx"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"y", " ", "sy"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"z", " ", "sz"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
     "  ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"diss", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
          RowBox[{"L", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"L", " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".", " ", 
             RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "L", "]"}]}], " ", "-", "\n", 
            "       ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "L", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
                "L", " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], " ", "+", " ", 
               RowBox[{"rho", " ", ".", " ", 
                RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "L", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
                "L"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
       "   ", 
       RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"sx", " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"rho", " ", ".", " ", "sx"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", 
                " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
                 RowBox[{"diss", "[", "sm", "]"}]}], " ", "+", "\n", 
                "          ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"rs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], 
                  ")"}], " ", 
                 RowBox[{"diss", "[", "sz", "]"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", ".", " ", 
              "#"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"sx", ",", " ", "sy", ",", " ", "sz"}], "}"}]}], ")"}], 
         " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           "rs"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[20]:= ",
 CellID->512383039,ExpressionUUID->"023f49e2-a747-9723-33c5-60cfd2f3fa09"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "21aa1c49-e16c-f406-57a9-9612901edf6c"],
 ". Last, the flux of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["r", "TI"], "2"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "289b85cd-827f-9a9c-58b8-1c97370be8e6"],
 " through the Bloch sphere, the quantity whose sign decides whether a \
trajectory can leave the set of density matrices:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->273308241,ExpressionUUID->"12f3dbee-abc4-6375-4280-d2cbce714e5f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"b", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Most", "@", 
      RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], "}"}], ",",
         " ", "rs"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           "rs"}], "]"}]}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"b", " ", ".", " ", "b"}]}], ")"}], " ", "/.", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"y", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[21]:= ",
 CellID->1809098798,ExpressionUUID->"7ed5da6f-a344-b859-26ea-dc48d6f60aa3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The result is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"1", "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "-", "2", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "-", "2", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2cfa2c34-ef50-7d46-5499-c6718ae547ac"],
 ", independent of the azimuth. Near the ground pole the relaxation term \
vanishes quadratically while the measurement term is linear, so the flux \
points inward everywhere exactly when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "2", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "362a4e41-4988-041f-5e2a-602b683d6f65"],
 ": a detector cannot extract more information than the dephasing it causes \
pays for."
}], "Text",
 CellID->156430199,ExpressionUUID->"01ed6b92-5a5f-fa78-3792-82dc5febc942"],

Cell["\<\
Example 3.2: NDSolve integrating a monitored qubit and its readout\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->724760089,ExpressionUUID->"107fa29c-d013-1000-4004-3bd9e1a6636a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Sample a Wiener path, interpolate it with a cubic, and give its derivative \
to ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6798df62-4cc7-e4e1-0da7-d74c6573cecb"],
 " as a classical forcing of the Stratonovich field:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->168408080,ExpressionUUID->"49f5450b-e8d1-97dd-7f8b-5d548965fd27"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
    RowBox[{"tf_", ",", " ", "h_", ",", " ", "seed_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "seed", "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"grid", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
          RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
            RowBox[{"tf", "/", "h"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
       "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Interpolation", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"grid", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Accumulate", "[", "\n", "         ", 
               RowBox[{"RandomVariate", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"grid", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                  "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "0."}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
          "]"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"InterpolationOrder", " ", "->", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "h_", ",", " ", 
     "seed_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
         RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "h", ",", " ", "seed"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz", ",", " ", "QQ"}], 
         "}"}]}], ",", " ", "t"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Join", "[", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Through", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Derivative", "[", "1", "]"}], " ", "/@", " ", "v"}], 
              ")"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "==", "\n", "       ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Through", "[", 
               RowBox[{"v", "[", "t", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], 
            " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Through", "[", 
                RowBox[{"v", "[", "t", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Wf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
         "     ", 
         RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Through", "[", 
            RowBox[{"v", "[", "0", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "init"}], 
          "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", "v", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tf"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"MaxStepSize", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"h", "/", "4"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[22]:= ",
 CellID->811283638,ExpressionUUID->"2570a8a5-7a6f-59e7-530f-410f7f1a2bcd"],

Cell["\<\
One trajectory of a driven, relaxing, quantum-limited readout, starting in \
the ground state with the record at zero:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->207978548,ExpressionUUID->"0b990c23-b656-01a6-39a6-a58cc3e3538c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tr", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "0.252", ",", " ", "0.1", ",", " ", "0.176", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", 
       "1.", ",", " ", "3."}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", "3.", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "120."}], ",", " ", "7"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"tr", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"tr", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<z(t)\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Q(t)\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[23]:= ",
 CellID->437474228,ExpressionUUID->"52243646-2fbd-210e-03db-a8204a487054"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The monitored component and the accumulated readout move together because \
one noise drives both. Switch off drive and relaxation and the two are locked \
by a closed law, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["tanh",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["arctanh",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "0"], "+", 
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1acd7f4d-3da3-7753-4af3-7717b4565db9"],
 ", which holds on the regularized path exactly by the ordinary chain rule:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->874582697,ExpressionUUID->"062d91f0-6326-41c0-2fd2-08ba16d3132a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"rG", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "0.352", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.176", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
       "0.", ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"trG", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
         RowBox[{"rG", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.6", ",", " ", "0."}], 
           "}"}], ",", " ", "3.", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"1", "/", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"40", " ", "0.352"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", "11"}], "]"}]}], 
       ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "3.", ",", " ", "1000"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
      "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "@", 
      RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"trG", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "s", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Tanh", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ArcTanh", "[", "0.6", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"rG", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"trG", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "s", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
       "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[24]:= ",
 CellID->11631581,ExpressionUUID->"1ac7f74a-ce09-be58-4afc-ef17ebbd04a2"],

Cell["\<\
The residual is at the solver's tolerance, not the noise scale: the qubit's \
population is literally a function of what the detector has read so far.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1933762060,ExpressionUUID->"6f6ad260-8ee1-565a-1569-d44a2a943ca0"],

Cell["\<\
4. Continuous Quantum Measurement, from Bayes' Rule to the Quantum Kalman \
Filter\
\>", "Section",
 CellID->1055776787,ExpressionUUID->"612fd791-c81e-86f2-10d4-cedae9a8ecd8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Source: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"/", "Users"}], "/", "mohammadb"}], "/", "Documents"}], "/", 
      "GitHub"}], "/", "mbahram"}], "/", "continuous"}], "-", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"measurement", "/", "Continuous"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Space", "/", "measurement"}]}], "-", "in", "-", "a", "-", 
   RowBox[{"potential", ".", "md"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "26dca2d1-2715-746d-4ee3-3b9b52a05eb7"]
}], "Text",
 CellID->1859711813,ExpressionUUID->"296a77cd-8fa3-dd44-5f6a-6e972a57a7ae"],

Cell["Summary", "Subsection",
 CellID->1348896709,ExpressionUUID->"6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A particle whose position is weakly and continuously measured, in any \
potential, simulated on a periodic grid. The stochastic Schrodinger equation \
is run as what it is in a laboratory: each step receives one noisy reading ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["x", "TI"], "_"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25b5b884-ef74-61b3-534a-31e18a013399"],
 ", updates the wavefunction by Bayes' rule (multiply by the square root of a \
Gaussian likelihood, renormalize), then evolves by a Strang split-operator \
step. The measurement half never sees the Hamiltonian, so any ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "574a2197-51ef-7938-7d49-b8d1679a4802"],
 " costs one pointwise phase."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1427211115,ExpressionUUID->"6e85e9ed-427b-8528-16ba-00b7770fec72"],

Cell["What should catch a physicist's attention:", "Text",
 CellID->2099805207,ExpressionUUID->"73b76025-96bb-3fff-214d-798f234f85c5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Measurement is literally Bayes' rule.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The amplitude update and \"likelihood times prior\" agree to machine \
precision, and the essay keeps a strict ledger: only the record is data; the \
conditional mean, width and noise are inferences."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1402006442,ExpressionUUID->"31f4c073-8ff6-126f-678b-da3d298360b5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Free particle: localization and heating.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A broad packet narrows to the steady width ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", "4", 
     StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["m", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "72ff7667-e560-b2c0-2285-68408c1a002a"],
 "; the averaged state's momentum variance grows exactly as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c9be80e-0554-61c1-24b8-0268ace1332b"],
 ", the uncertainty-principle price of position information; the leftover \
offset is shown to be first-order splitting bias by halving the step."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1901179466,ExpressionUUID->"106b7ad8-6378-599b-4069-7382160d2be1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A cat collapses, and the observer can tell which way from the \
readings alone.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A running log-odds built from the noisy outcomes tracks the hidden lobe \
mass on the grid; different noise histories pick different lobes."
}], "Item",
 CellID->210724908,ExpressionUUID->"7e6f7c7a-fa8f-2da1-2615-7627ff3a778b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Harmonic trap: squeezing below the zero-point at any strength.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The conditional covariances obey a deterministic Riccati equation solved \
in closed form with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], ",", "\[HBar]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "304452a4-201b-d64c-607c-4b0e51afbc96"],
 " symbolic. With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "=", "2", "\[HBar]", 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "/", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6beff1f8-c64a-83a6-1994-e8a5f3fcd18c"],
 ", the steady variance in ground-state units is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"2", 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "2"]}]], "-", "1"}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "/", 
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b5b9263-9199-4e16-7978-144d202c157c"],
 ", proved below one and decreasing for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "475d7054-346c-a3cc-6d63-6a1ebd1ef116"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData["Resolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],
 " over all ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],
 "), with limits ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "2"], "/", "8"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "/", 
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"],
 ". The grid, which never assumes a Gaussian, lands on the predicted pure \
squeezed Gaussian."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1992790374,ExpressionUUID->"055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The quantum Kalman filter.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Five numbers updated from the readings alone reproduce the conditional \
mean that the 256-amplitude wavefunction carries: the filter \
levitated-nanoparticle and membrane experiments run."
}], "Item",
 CellID->292747604,ExpressionUUID->"2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The price of an imperfect detector, in closed form.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " At efficiency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"],
 " the steady purity is exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],
 ", independent of trap, mass and strength; squeezing below the zero-point \
needs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "\[GreaterEqual]", "2", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]}]], "/", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],
 ", so at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", "0.34"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],
 " and the essay's strength the state sits above the vacuum because the \
threshold is not reached, not because inefficiency forbids squeezing (cf. a \
levitated nanoparticle tracked to about 1.3 times its zero-point motion)."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1553818268,ExpressionUUID->"10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The averaged state never settles.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Energy rises exactly linearly at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],
 " in any potential (the double commutator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["[",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"]}], 
     StyleBox["]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],
 " is a constant); the heating lives entirely in the random wandering of the \
packet's center, whose It\[OHat] power equals the Lindblad rate exactly."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1870754514,ExpressionUUID->"0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],

Cell["\<\
Example 4.1: squeezing below the zero-point, and what detector efficiency \
costs, in closed form\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->1358728755,ExpressionUUID->"0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],

Cell["\<\
The conditional covariances in a harmonic trap obey a Riccati flow that never \
sees the record. Keep everything symbolic and select the physical fixed point:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->935019337,ExpressionUUID->"63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"riccati", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"2", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Cc", "/", "m"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Sx", "^", "2"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Sp", "/", "m"}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"m", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}], " ", "Sx"}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", "Sx", " ", "Cc"}]}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", "m", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}], " ", "Cc"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Cc", "^", "2"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"steady", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SolveValues", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
       RowBox[{"riccati", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"Sx", ",", " ", "Cc", ",", " ", "Sp"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "//",
     " ", "FullSimplify"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"positiveQ", "[", "sol_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"TrueQ", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Resolve", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"ForAll", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
         "m", ",", " ", "\[Lambda]", ",", " ", "\[Omega]", ",", " ", 
          "\[HBar]"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">=", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "|", " ", 
            RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "\[Element]", " ", 
          "Reals"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}], ",",
       " ", "Reals"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"SxSS", ",", " ", "CcSS", ",", " ", "SpSS"}], "}"}], " ", "=", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"SelectFirst", "[", 
    RowBox[{"steady", ",", " ", "positiveQ"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"as", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SxSS", " ", "SpSS"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"CcSS", "^", "2"}]}], ",", " ", "as"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[25]:= ",
 CellID->642744358,ExpressionUUID->"67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], "/", "4"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],
 ": the steady state is pure. In ground-state units the position variance is \
one function of one dimensionless strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1478372881,ExpressionUUID->"0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"u", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}], 
     "]"}], "/", "u"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"SxSS", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "m", " ", "\[Omega]"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "==",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[HBar]", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", "/", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"m", " ", 
           RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     "as"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Resolve", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ForAll", "[", 
      RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"u", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",",
      " ", "Reals"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Asymptotic", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"u", " ", ">=", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Asymptotic", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "Infinity", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"u", " ", ">=", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[26]:= ",
 CellID->124263719,ExpressionUUID->"0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The position is squeezed below the zero-point variance for every \
measurement strength, weakly as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "2"], "/", "8"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],
 " and strongly as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "/", 
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"],
 ". A detector catching a fraction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],
 " of the light rescales ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "\[Rule]", 
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3279c00f-c9e2-8758-6206-da68ef94eda2"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "\[Rule]", "\[HBar]", "/", 
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "50b12ff8-e606-85f7-004e-c6a593b0efdd"],
 " in the information terms only:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1310926461,ExpressionUUID->"640f47a5-4648-c62d-0c35-5e0f73e2ad77"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"SxE", ",", " ", "CcE", ",", " ", "SpE"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"SxSS", ",", " ", "CcSS", ",", " ", "SpSS"}], "}"}], " ", "/.", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Eta]", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"SxE", " ", "SpE"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"CcE", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"0", " ", "<", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "<=", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
       
       RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Reduce", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}], " ", "u"}], "]"}], "/", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}]}], " ", "<=", " ", "1"}], " ", "&&",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"u", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
       RowBox[{"0", " ", "<", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "<", " ", "1"}]}], ",", " ",
       "u", ",", " ", "Reals"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[27]:= ",
 CellID->1124211690,ExpressionUUID->"63a48922-0fac-666c-115b-208caa594cb6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The steady purity is exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "387a9e0d-0234-0e73-6819-1057b7c15559"],
 ", whatever the trap, the particle or the strength; and going below the \
vacuum is still possible at any nonzero efficiency, but only past ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "*"], "=", "2", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]}]], "/", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f64ca0d-9927-5f44-651b-ec5718d225ae"],
 ", a threshold that diverges as the detector fails."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1335749844,ExpressionUUID->"399d1ff3-4632-be92-6fa2-96bd73c404f8"],

Cell["\<\
Example 4.2: five numbers recover what 256 amplitudes compute\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->793802945,ExpressionUUID->"1170384d-2f38-2c50-470f-b2174acd76ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A grid, a Gaussian packet, the Bayesian measurement step and a Strang \
split-operator step (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "=", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ce33075-6d34-44a7-1490-aa3f04c12e8d"],
 "):"
}], "Text",
 CellID->631769182,ExpressionUUID->"54e2b6d5-0ba4-5b19-7c91-2f9fae512663"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"hbar", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"mass", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"grid", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n_", ",", " ", "l_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"dx", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"l", "/", "n"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<n\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "n"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<x\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dx", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "n"}], "/", "2"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
       "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi", " ", 
           RowBox[{"hbar", "/", "l"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"RotateLeft", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "n"}], "/", "2"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
           " ", 
           RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "|>"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ft", "[", "psi_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Fourier", "[", 
    RowBox[{"psi", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FourierParameters", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ift", "[", "c_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"InverseFourier", "[", 
    RowBox[{"c", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FourierParameters", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"gaussian", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "x0_", ",", " ", "p0_", ",", " ", "s_"}], "]"}], 
   " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<x\>\"", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "x0"}], ")"}],
          "^", "2"}]}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"4", " ", 
         RowBox[{"s", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"I", " ", "p0", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<x\>\"", "]"}], "/", "hbar"}]}]}], "]"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"xMean", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "psi_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<x\>\"", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "psi", "]"}], "^", "2"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"outcome", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "lam_", ",", " ", "dt_"}], "]"}], "[", "psi_", 
    "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"RandomChoice", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "psi", "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<x\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "+", "\n", "   ", 
    RowBox[{"RandomVariate", "[", 
     RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"4", " ", "lam", " ", "dt"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"measUpdate", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "lam_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", " ", "xb_"}], 
     "]"}], "[", "psi_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "lam"}], " ", "dt", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<x\>\"", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "xb"}], ")"}], 
        "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "psi"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"potentialStep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "V_", ",", " ", "dt_"}], "]"}], "[", "psi_", 
    "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"V", "[", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<x\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"dt", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "hbar"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}], " ", "psi"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"kineticStep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "dt_"}], "]"}], "[", "psi_", "]"}], " ", ":=", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"ift", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<p\>\"", "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"dt", "/", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "mass", " ", "hbar"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"ft", "[", "psi", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"evolveStep", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", " ", "V_", ",", " ", "dt_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"potentialStep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "V", ",", " ", "dt"}], "]"}], " ", "@*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"kineticStep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "dt"}], "]"}], " ", "@*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"potentialStep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "V", ",", " ", "dt"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"trajectory", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "g_", ",", " ", "V_", ",", " ", "lam_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", " ", 
      "nt_"}], "]"}], "[", "psi0_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"NestList", "[", "\n", "   ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"evolveStep", "[", 
        RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "V", ",", " ", "dt"}], "]"}], "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"measUpdate", "[", 
         RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "lam", ",", " ", "dt", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Sow", "@", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"outcome", "[", 
             RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "lam", ",", " ", "dt"}], "]"}], "[", "#", 
            "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
     "psi0", ",", " ", "nt"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[28]:= ",
 CellID->1873681340,ExpressionUUID->"6334ac9c-43f1-85c0-12cb-45c67585ef2a"],

Cell["\<\
Watch a particle in a trap starting from the ground state, keeping both the \
full conditional wavefunction and the stream of readings:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1468251080,ExpressionUUID->"74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"wR", " ", "=", " ", "1."}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"lamH", " ", "=", " ", "2."}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"SxZP", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"hbar", "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", "mass", " ", "wR"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"SpZP", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"hbar", " ", "mass", " ", 
    RowBox[{"wR", "/", "2"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"gH", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"grid", "[", 
    RowBox[{"256", ",", " ", "24."}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"dtH", " ", "=", " ", "0.002"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"ntH", " ", "=", " ", "1500"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"states", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "outs", "}"}]}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "21", "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Reap", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"trajectory", "[", 
        RowBox[{"gH", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"0.5", " ", "mass", " ", 
           RowBox[{"wR", "^", "2"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"#", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", "lamH", ",", " ", 
         "dtH", ",", " ", "ntH"}], "]"}], "[", 
       RowBox[{"gaussian", "[", 
        RowBox[{"gH", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "SxZP", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
   ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"xGrid", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"xMean", "[", 
      RowBox[{"gH", ",", " ", "#"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
    "states"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[29]:= ",
 CellID->1989234463,ExpressionUUID->"735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],

Cell["\<\
The quantum Kalman filter: two means nudged by the surprise in each reading, \
three covariances following the record-blind Riccati flow from Example 4.1:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1607696641,ExpressionUUID->"335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"num", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", "->", " ", "hbar"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", "->", " ", "mass"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", "->", " ", "wR"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", "->", " ", "lamH"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"covDrift", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"sx", ",", " ", "cc", ",", " ", "sp"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"riccati", " ", "/.", " ", "num"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sx", " ", "->", " ", "sx"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Cc", " ", "->", " ", "cc"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sp", " ", "->", " ", "sp"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"filterStep", "[", "dt_", "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "mx_", ",", " ", "mp_", ",", " ", "sx_", ",", " ", "cc_", ",", " ", 
       "sp_"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "dY_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"dWf", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dY", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "lamH", "]"}], " ", "mx", " ", "dt"}]}]}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"mx", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"mp", "/", "mass"}], " ", "dt"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "lamH", "]"}], " ", "sx", " ", "dWf"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"mp", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"mass", " ", 
           RowBox[{"wR", "^", "2"}], " ", "mx", " ", "dt"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "lamH", "]"}], " ", "cc", " ", "dWf"}]}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"sx", ",", " ", "cc", ",", " ", "sp"}], "}"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dt", " ", 
         RowBox[{"covDrift", "[", 
          RowBox[{"sx", ",", " ", "cc", ",", " ", "sp"}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mFilter", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"FoldList", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"filterStep", "[", "dtH", "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "SxZP", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
        "SpZP"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "lamH", "]"}], " ", "dtH", " ", "outs"}]}], "]"}],
     "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"xGrid", ",", " ", "mFilter"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"DataRange", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"ntH", " ", "dtH"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Thick", ",", " ", "Gray"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Red", ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<grid (256 amplitudes)\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<Kalman filter (5 numbers)\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<\[LeftAngleBracket]x\[RightAngleBracket]\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[30]:= ",
 CellID->1817342824,ExpressionUUID->"3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"],

Cell["\<\
The dashed filter, fed nothing but the noisy readings, sits on the \
conditional mean of the full wavefunction; their largest gap is a small \
fraction of the range the mean covers, the cost of a finite time step:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->530774412,ExpressionUUID->"045023ab-c37d-b770-2c6f-baf4f6091a5a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Max", "@", 
   RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
    RowBox[{"mFilter", " ", "-", " ", "xGrid"}], "]"}]}], "/", 
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Max", "@", "xGrid"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Min", "@", "xGrid"}]}], ")"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[31]:= ",
 CellID->599957810,ExpressionUUID->"73e8aeff-5b91-f8f4-2197-47b95e25cade"],

Cell["\<\
The wavefunction is never needed to track the particle: in a quadratic \
potential the conditional state is a Gaussian whose shape is fixed in advance \
and whose center follows the record.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1899946997,ExpressionUUID->"33e490f1-5bc8-e939-619b-09bb5e62b803"],

Cell["5. Transmon cQED: Wolfram x Qolab Collaboration", "Section",
 CellID->1051619128,ExpressionUUID->"794a4309-908b-2549-2f4a-5b53213f8f93"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Source: no authored ",
 Cell[".md", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "167ebcf0-2b32-2a61-3e05-35ba4ec7794b"],
 " exists. The text below was read from the machine conversion ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"/", "Users"}], "/", "mohammadb"}], "/", "Documents"}], "/", 
       "GitHub"}], "/", "mbahram"}], "/", "QIS"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"book", "/", "source"}], "/", "hardware"}]}], "-", "second", "-", 
   RowBox[{"half", "/", "00"}], "-", "official", "-", "tutorial", "-", 
   RowBox[{"notebooks", "/", "converted"}], "-", 
   RowBox[{"md", "/", "TransmonLab"}], "-", "APS", "-", "Wolfram", "-", 
   RowBox[{"Qolab", ".", "md"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15eb24b6-b946-3a65-43e8-bdf038f0894f"],
 "; the live source is ",
 Cell["\<\
/Users/mohammadb/Documents/GitHub/mbahram/TransmonLab/Examples/TransmonLab-\
APS-Wolfram-Qolab.nb\
\>", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"27d2a24c-1e84-19ee-4de1-44169b316b34"],
 ". The examples load the TransmonLab paclet from ",
 Cell["\<\
/Users/mohammadb/Documents/GitHub/mbahram/TransmonLab/TransmonLab/\
\>", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"285985c7-a1c8-13eb-5866-1ca0d07d6131"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1921351195,ExpressionUUID->"57868ed1-450c-c474-7dbd-279b6cbeaf5e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Notes for review: (1) the converted ",
 Cell[".md", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "0c5e608e-35dc-f74f-3466-79e8bc6edd95"],
 ", committed in the QIS-book repository, contains the Qolab access token in \
plain text in its ",
 Cell[BoxData["SystemCredential"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1a1e4090-3303-05ed-4a26-59da46b66f37"],
 " line; it should be removed and the token rotated. (2) The tomography cell \
reports the linear-inversion Bloch vector, which here has length about 1.12 \
(TransmonLab itself warns it is unphysical); the maximum-likelihood estimate \
is physical and closer to the target, so Example 5.2 uses it."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1207491739,ExpressionUUID->"10256af3-3972-af7a-41da-83bdb804f240"],

Cell["Summary", "Subsection",
 CellID->216741342,ExpressionUUID->"457602f1-d86e-ac86-730d-9bbad918f6ec"],

Cell["\<\
The demo shown at APS 2026 with Qolab: take a transmon from its circuit \
Hamiltonian to a prepared qubit state, and then all the way down to the \
digitizer, where the state exists only as clouds of single-shot (I, Q) \
points. The same analysis then runs on real IQ data from Qolab's hardware.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2096934290,ExpressionUUID->"499f95c1-a958-6c18-7fa4-0caac8ed3762"],

Cell["What should catch a physicist's attention:", "Text",
 CellID->1367217003,ExpressionUUID->"0f1e874b-6d22-b8ab-3525-1f1504d40af1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["From circuit to qubit.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The Cooper-pair-box Hamiltonian ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"4", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["C", "TI"]], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], "^"], "-", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"], "-", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["J", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["cos",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"], "^"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0c02104f-9807-e6c4-3431-8a2919b3cc2e"],
 " in the charge basis, with the spectrum flattening against offset charge as \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["J", "TI"]], "/", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["C", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f909018-5ea1-6a32-15af-0a425b543918"],
 " grows: why the transmon works."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1372538143,ExpressionUUID->"2f4595f3-090a-1216-557a-0cbda8bf617c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Any state with two hardware operations.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A virtual Z (a zero-duration phase update of the drive oscillator, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CurlyPhi]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"r", "o", "t"}], "TI"]], "=", "\[CurlyPhi]", "+", "\[Pi]", "/", 
   "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06385f5e-e9d4-4e6c-2fd8-571b886114b6"],
 ") followed by one calibrated pulse reaches any ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Theta]", "TI"], ",", "\[CurlyPhi]"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25d2fb85-296f-82e5-53e1-f2ef481bd0cf"],
 "; the pulse-area theorem gives the amplitude, a simulated Power Rabi sweep \
calibrates it, and the simulated Bloch vector lands on the analytic target."
}], "Item",
 CellID->485911656,ExpressionUUID->"3b9a140e-d97a-4136-69b9-8e6bd80f101c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Measurement is a cavity, not a projector.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The readout resonator rings up along two qubit-dependent spirals ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "."], 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}]], "=", "-", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Kappa]", "TI"], "/", "2", "\[PlusMinus]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Chi]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}]], "-", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[Epsilon]", 
   StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4f9438da-b80f-a114-75ab-b18439bbf07e"],
 " whose separation sets the signal-to-noise; with these parameters the \
library flags that Purcell decay through the cavity dominates ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["T", "TI"], "1"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7281c19b-2602-dcd4-22be-d8c553b4a63e"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellID->181917407,ExpressionUUID->"3c8746fc-db76-c487-64bd-5fb9de00aeed"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The whole chain, both directions.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Stochastic single-shot IQ records (raw and integrated, time-resolved) for \
three tomography bases, then the inverse: Gaussian-mixture fitting, \
assignment errors, linear-inversion and maximum-likelihood tomography, \
posterior distributions of the Bloch components."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1906087345,ExpressionUUID->"11f0f87a-e6f0-91cd-478f-f227928ae317"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Real hardware in the same pipeline.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " One function call (",
 Cell[BoxData["QolabExperiment"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "473164ce-b547-c1f4-6ecf-7da83cf393de"],
 ") returns IQ data from a Qolab qubit, analyzed by the identical code as the \
simulation."
}], "Item",
 CellID->354048744,ExpressionUUID->"12c4fc3b-e00c-2bba-42fb-f66491b97980"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Decoherence and DRAG.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Purity and fidelity decay on the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["T", "TI"], "2"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d7e6892-18cd-6f45-4b05-81dc997835af"],
 " scale after preparation, and a DRAG pulse reduces leakage to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{"2"},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "325c8f47-cd85-89da-6263-2720e431db20"],
 " in a three-level (Duffing) simulation."
}], "Item",
 CellID->786710823,ExpressionUUID->"43fcea2e-12ab-c026-7183-0388a75f930c"],

Cell["\<\
Example 5.1: arbitrary state preparation, calibrated from the pulse area\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->1859374462,ExpressionUUID->"5b416c07-c3d3-bf4f-097e-8660f6670595"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
  "PacletDirectoryLoad", 
   "[", "\"\</Users/mohammadb/Documents/GitHub/mbahram/TransmonLab/\
TransmonLab/\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<TransmonLab`\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sys", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"TransmonSystem", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<QubitFrequency\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"5.10", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "9"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<ResonatorFrequency\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"6.00", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "9"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Anharmonicity\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "220"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "6"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Coupling\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"100", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "6"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<CavityLinewidth\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"1", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "6"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<T1\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"50", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "6"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<T2\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"30", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "6"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<OmegaMax\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi", "*", "42", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "6"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<EpsilonMax\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi", "*", "5", "*", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "6"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<NMax\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "5"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"gaussPulse", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Gaussian\>\"", ",", " ", "50"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"readoutPulse", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<FlatTop\>\"", ",", " ", "500", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<RiseTime\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "10"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[32]:= ",
 CellID->544914423,ExpressionUUID->"5add4728-e92e-eff1-0ae3-5f7588d8b5db"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On resonance only the pulse area matters, so the rotation angle per unit \
amplitude is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
    StyleBox["max",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   StyleBox["\[Integral]",
    FontSize->1.15 Inherited], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "621761a3-d300-b412-122d-780ce6ba1f78"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1088734259,ExpressionUUID->"5b08d465-1dcc-fb87-0937-ce4f947ec9ed"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"thetaPerA", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sys", "[", "\"\<OmegaMax\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"gaussPulse", "[", "\"\<EnvelopeArea\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"10", "^", 
     RowBox[{"-", "9"}]}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[33]:= ",
 CellID->476175344,ExpressionUUID->"7d3ffb2e-09a8-fc78-24c4-f288a842c742"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Target ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Theta]", "TI"], "=", "\[Pi]", "/", "3"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4139b36b-52b1-2977-70c6-2b356744785d"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CurlyPhi]", "=", "\[Pi]", "/", "6"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "494d6e39-7750-b6eb-7f72-806302ea1c31"],
 ": one frame rotation, one scaled pulse, then readout:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->201272189,ExpressionUUID->"39b01e29-d171-5c92-6f4f-9072e00426f8"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"thT", ",", " ", "phT"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "3"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "6"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"aT", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"thT", "/", "thetaPerA"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"seq", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PulseSequence", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"FrameRotation", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Qubit\>\"", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"phT", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Drive", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Amplitude", "[", "aT", "]"}], "@", "gaussPulse"}], ",", 
       " ", "\"\<Qubit\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Sync", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Qubit\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Resonator\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"Readout", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "readoutPulse", ",", " ", "\"\<Resonator\>\"", ",", " ", "500"}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"res", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"TransmonPhysics", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sys", ",", " ", "seq", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Model\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<QubitOnly\>\""}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"bz", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"#", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"gaussPulse", "[", "\"\<Duration\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "9"}]}]}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"res", "[", "\"\<BlochTrajectories\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"bz", ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "@", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "thT", "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "phT", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "thT", "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "phT", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "thT", "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[34]:= ",
 CellID->320292756,ExpressionUUID->"4f6d713e-2461-11c8-7513-69784d146312"],

Cell["\<\
The simulated Bloch vector at the end of the pulse sits on the analytic \
target to the accuracy allowed by the truncated Gaussian envelope. The same \
calibration constant appears experimentally as the period of a Power Rabi \
sweep:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1146801282,ExpressionUUID->"14ad582f-66ff-93eb-3c53-5189128be131"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"TransmonPhysics", "[", 
   RowBox[{"sys", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"PulseSequence", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Drive", "[", 
       RowBox[{"gaussPulse", ",", " ", "\"\<Qubit\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Sync", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Qubit\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Resonator\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
      "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"Readout", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "readoutPulse", ",", " ", "\"\<Resonator\>\"", ",", " ", "500"}], 
       "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Sweep", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Amplitude\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "0.02"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
    "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Model\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<QubitOnly\>\""}]}], "]"}], 
  "[", "\"\<Plot\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[35]:= ",
 CellID->41202278,ExpressionUUID->"4f7ea056-2d28-85ec-7505-3a1044c2ef36"],

Cell["Example 5.2: from the digitizer back to the Bloch vector", "Subsection",
 CellID->1124146653,ExpressionUUID->"16b00368-b832-202d-3e4f-9b3239c77377"],

Cell["The cavity pointer states, one spiral per qubit state:", "Text",
 CellID->1232284935,ExpressionUUID->"06d00634-a672-f252-2eef-9871d304c0b8"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dr", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"DispersiveReadout", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sys", ",", " ", "readoutPulse"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"IQPlot", "[", "dr", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[36]:= ",
 CellID->2082395230,ExpressionUUID->"05feeeaf-4f58-f7b7-3385-07096ad2dd9d"],

Cell["\<\
Prepare the same target, rotated into each tomography basis, and simulate 200 \
noisy single shots per basis:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2045146513,ExpressionUUID->"583a98af-415b-100e-09d9-110970ee6354"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"bv", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlochVector", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
       RowBox[{"thT", "/", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
        RowBox[{"I", " ", "phT"}], "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
        RowBox[{"thT", "/", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"thX", ",", " ", "phX"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Rest", "@", 
     RowBox[{"ToSphericalCoordinates", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"RotationMatrix", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "Pi"}], "/", "2"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ".",
        " ", "bv"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"thY", ",", " ", "phY"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Rest", "@", 
     RowBox[{"ToSphericalCoordinates", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"RotationMatrix", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ".",
        " ", "bv"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"iqt", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IQTrajectory", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sys", ",", " ", "dr", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Bases\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<x\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<y\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], 
       "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<NShots\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "200"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<InitialStates\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<z\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1.0", ",", " ", "thT", ",", " ", "phT"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<x\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1.0", ",", " ", "thX", ",", " ", "phX"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<y\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1.0", ",", " ", "thY", ",", " ", "phY"}], "}"}]}]}], 
       "|>"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Seed\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "123"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"iqa", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IQAnalysis", "[", 
    RowBox[{"iqt", "[", "\"\<MeasurementData\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[37]:= ",
 CellID->25123057,ExpressionUUID->"07beae85-a317-6bf9-2d45-47eed6a239c3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Reconstruct the state by maximum likelihood, which keeps it inside the \
Bloch ball, and compare with the target (the ",
 Cell[BoxData["IQAnalysis"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "503c05d1-55e8-8c5e-01c3-9c9b6382d6a4"],
 " call above prints two messages: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"IQAnalysis", "::", "nonphysical"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60049622-f570-0e0e-103b-0f8ffc055554"],
 " for the linear-inversion estimate, which is why it is not used, and a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"FindMinimum", "::", "lstol"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "40ea559d-da93-7842-70ea-4cc6df264aa8"],
 " from its internal fit, which does not affect the result):"
}], "Text",
 CellID->371825621,ExpressionUUID->"23ccc6ee-92c0-e596-51f3-dfc8277acffc"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"target", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "@", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "thT", "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "phT", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "thT", "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "phT", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "thT", "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mleB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"iqa", "[", "\"\<DensityMatrixMLE\>\"", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
        "#"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", " ", "/@", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], ")"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"mleB", ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
    RowBox[{"mleB", " ", "-", " ", "target"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"iqa", "[", "\"\<BlochVectorAround\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[38]:= ",
 CellID->1439628390,ExpressionUUID->"114d8d02-b276-9c05-4772-256fc700e76f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "From nothing but clouds of (I, Q) points, the reconstructed Bloch vector \
lands near the prepared one, with posterior error bars of a few hundredths \
per component from 200 shots. Swapping ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"iqt", "[", "\"\<MeasurementData\>\"", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2dc22b63-32d1-862f-5bf1-c34d4765ed75"],
 " for the table returned by ",
 Cell[BoxData["QolabExperiment"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36ea7e2c-072a-2221-5eea-7076b2df710b"],
 " runs the identical analysis on real hardware."
}], "Text",
 CellID->497245720,ExpressionUUID->"5b23761c-2477-64e8-0ad1-68464d024e32"],

Cell["\<\
6. The Gravitational Soliton: Ground State, Finite-Element Extrapolation and \
Virial Verification\
\>", "Section",
 CellID->1090726268,ExpressionUUID->"73216bcf-7cf1-61ac-22de-82a9748433f6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Source: ",
 Cell["\<\
/Users/mohammadb/Nextcloud/Mads/Quantum/SchrdingerNewton/SN1_\
GroundStateSoliton_v3_reviewed-MB.md\
\>", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"69fa63e8-c0ca-4913-1f9a-7ab5f17f1879"]
