 CellID->2124519200,ExpressionUUID->"409bca18-cbd6-e54d-70b8-ec45ee60cf97"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Notes for review: the file still carries reviewer dialogue (the line \
beginning \"what about ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalPhi]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "0", 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10b62b5f-1d3f-f012-404d-c31994cbc378"],
 "? Mads: \[Ellipsis] Oliver: \[Ellipsis]\" and the sentence \"It looks as if \
at \[Phi](0) we have a Neumann zero BC\" after the potential plot), and the \
closing section says \"the small virial mismatch at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["R", "TI"], "=", "400"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79984792-c453-565a-2fb8-5edfede63ca0"],
 "\" while the computation uses ",
 Cell[BoxData[
